      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "A .bin exported by this app is a full dump, so restore it starting at block 0 — the UID, lock, capability and password pages are skipped automatically. “Allow writing protected pages” lifts that guard; it can permanently brick a tag, so leave it off unless you truly need it.",
